6	/**
7	 * Fiscal-year rules for date-derived owner values. The fiscal year starts on 1 July, so a date in
8	 * July or later belongs to the fiscal year ending the following calendar year (the Australian
9	 * convention): e.g. 1 July 2026 is fiscal year 2027, while 30 June 2026 is fiscal year 2026. Shared
10	 * by {@link AssignOwnerMembershipNumber} (the membership number's year segment) and the owner mapper
11	 * (the {@code fiscalYear} field and tenure-based membership points) so every date-derived value uses
12	 * one definition.
